// At 8 clues the turn is forced, so the convention must leave a legal clue.
//
// `Alternating Clues & Brown (6 Suits)`, T35. will-bot69 has 8 tokens -- so a
// discard is illegal -- and 15 of 30, below the 60% switch, so target parity
// still binds and every clue is reactive. The previous clue was a colour one,
// so Alternating Clues left only RANK clues legal, and every one of them read
// as a MISTAKE. `analyse_clues` drops MISTAKE readings, so ZERO candidates
